                            {
                                "example_id": "ebf7858c-65ae-4b79-9309-3e4e99de9608",
                                "sense_id": "ac4c979c-7b90-3686-b12e-d6637b6747b9",
                                "text": "Early in the 21st Century, THE TYRELL CORPORATION advanced Robot evolution into the NEXUS phase — a being virtually identical to a human — known as a Replicant.\n The NEXUS 6 Replicants were superior in strength and agility, and at least equal in intelligence, to the genetic engineers who created them.\n Replicants were used Off-world as slave labor, in the hazardous exploration and colonization of other planets."
